			"Message": "style(Rest): Standardize quote usage and import ordering in CLI wrapper\n\nEnforce single quotes for all string literals and reorganize imports into the canonical sequence: `node:child_process`, `node:path`, `node:url`, `node:fs` within the `Rest.js` entry point.\n\nRefactor the `execSync` invocation from multi-line argument mapping to a compact single-line template string expression, while preserving strict binary path escaping. Align the file with the project's strict code style conventions and PascalCase guidelines, ensuring consistency with recent shell script and Rust source standardization efforts in the `Rest` component.",
